  "articleBody": "Getting ready to give your home a fresh coat of paint? It's exciting, but knowing what to expect can make the whole process smoother. Typically, it all starts with an on-site walkthrough. This is where we figure out exactly what needs painting – just walls, or ceilings, trim, doors, and even closets or cabinets too. This thorough look helps us create a detailed, written quote that spells out everything, from the specific products we’ll use to which areas are covered and how payments will work. You'll also want to know about timing; how long will it take, and when can we actually start? We provide schedule estimates after we’ve measured and scoped out your home. Remember, good preparation is key! We'll cover patching, sanding, and priming, and clarify how many coats will be applied. It’s also crucial to confirm how we'll protect your furniture and floors, and what the cleanup process looks like each day. Don't be shy about asking questions on these details, as they make a huge difference in the final outcome and your peace of mind. If you’re looking to get a clear picture of your next interior painting project, reach out and let's discuss your home’s needs.",
